# Tumble Jungle Core (PlayTab Enterprise)

## Enterprise Score Gate
MUST NOT mark work done unless Average ≥ 9.0, no dimension < 8, and critical dims (Theme/A11y, POS/Till Flow, Glass UI Components, Pulse AI Engine) each ≥ 9. Paste scorecard on completion.

## North Star
Ultra-fast child play admission, live floor safety & capacity tracking, seamless multi-outlet F&B ordering (Cafe + Restaurant KOT), instant Bhutan RMA EMV QR payments, and AI smart assistance.

## Canonical Docs
- `docs/CURSOR_BUILD_PLAN.md`
- `docs/ENTERPRISE_SPEC.md`
- `.cursorrules`

## MUST
- Compose from `components/ui/glass/*` (`GlassCard`, `GlassButton`, `GlassBadge`, `GlassTabs`, `GlassChips`)
- Run `npm run build` or `npm run lint` before claiming done; fix TypeScript and lint errors in-place
- Currency Nu. (Bhutanese Ngultrum); support Bhutan bank payload (mBoB, BNB, BDBL, Druk PNB)
- Quick Unlock PIN modal with 15-minute idle lock on financial/admin screens
- Mobile & tablet responsive POS layout (10.1" / 15.6" touch screens)

## MUST NOT
- Use `rotateX`, `rotateY`, perspective tilt, or faux receipt paper tears
- Use bare `text-white` or `text-slate-100` on light frosted glass
- Hardcode credentials or secrets in client code
- Break existing PostgreSQL till event sourcing or offline backup logic
